    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.760" end="00:04.610" ttm:agent="v1">Get up on the floor, dancin' all night long</p>
      <p begin="00:04.610" end="00:08.770" ttm:agent="v1">Get up on the floor, dancin' 'til the break of dawn</p>
      <p begin="00:08.770" end="00:12.630" ttm:agent="v1">Get up on the floor, dancin' 'til the break of dawn</p>
      <p begin="00:12.630" end="00:15.080" ttm:agent="v1">Get up on the floor</p>
      <p begin="00:15.080" end="00:16.580" ttm:agent="v1">Dancin'</p>
      <p begin="00:16.310" end="00:24.310" ttm:agent="v1">All the time, my baby you on my mind and I don't know why, yeah, but the feeling is fine</p>
      <p begin="00:24.440" end="00:32.440" ttm:agent="v1">Can't you see, honey, you are for me? How we were meant to be, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:32.520" end="00:40.520" ttm:agent="v1">Dancin' in the moonlight, gazing at the stars so bright</p>
      <p begin="00:40.610" end="00:48.610" ttm:agent="v1">Holding you until the sunrise, sleeping until the midnight</p>
      <p begin="00:48.760" end="00:52.660" ttm:agent="v1">Get up on the floor, dancin' all night long</p>
      <p begin="00:52.660" end="00:56.750" ttm:agent="v1">Get up on the floor, dancin' 'til the break of dawn</p>
