      <p begin="01:03.070" end="01:04.620" ttm:agent="v1">Dancin'</p>
      <p begin="01:04.620" end="01:06.590" ttm:agent="v1">Dancin' is what to do</p>
      <p begin="01:06.590" end="01:08.530" ttm:agent="v1">Dancin' is when I think of you</p>
      <p begin="01:08.530" end="01:10.520" ttm:agent="v1">Dancin' is what clears my soul</p>
      <p begin="01:10.520" end="01:12.580" ttm:agent="v1">Dancin' is what makes me whole</p>
      <p begin="01:12.580" end="01:14.690" ttm:agent="v1">Dancin' is what to do</p>
